;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;日常系コマンド
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;==================================================
;300,会話
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_300
;コマンド共通メッセージ(TRAIN_MESSAGE) 
;削除すると「～話をした。」とかが消えます
;口上メイン呼出
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_300_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_300_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	IF TFLAG:193 == -3 ;custom code, hate mark 3
		RETURN
	ENDIF
	;霧
	IF TIME:5 == 7 && !RAND:6 ;custom code, random chance
		PRINTFORML 「The fog-shrouded Gensokyo seems like a perfect setting for humans and youkai to mingle, don't you think?」
		PRINTFORMW 「...」
		PRINTFORMW 「...I didn't mean to "mingle" in that way either, so don't go there.」
	ELSE
		IF RAND:20 == 0 ;perhaps it's actually a reimu reference with the way she phrased the ability, or just the ability to fly in general, I combined both
		PRINTFORML 「You ever wondered what the ability to float means? Isn't it just the same as flying in the air, anyway?」
		CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"Don't you think it's more fantastic to be able to fly with just your head alone than to have your average realistic complete package in one piece?"
		PRINTFORML 「That's right, I'm saying that the typical depiction of a flying humanoid is way out of fashion.」
		PRINTFORML 「Even humans can do that nowadays, it's nothing special!」
		PRINTFORMW Banki chews her lip in frustration, as if reliving some bad experience from the past.
		ELSEIF RAND:19 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「Come to think of it, I heard that there's this youkai that's been popping up lately.」
		PRINTFORMW 「...Eh?! No, I'm not talking about the umbrella youkai! I mean, something much scarier, you know...」
		ELSEIF RAND:18 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「Come to think of it, I heard that there's this youkai that's been popping up lately.」
		PRINTFORML 「...Wha-?! You never heard of it? It's called Dullahan Under the Willow...」
		PRINTFORMW 「...F-Fair enough. I'm surprised it's still not a household name. Oh well...」
		ELSEIF RAND:17 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「I ran into an umbrella youkai on the street the other day.」
		PRINTFORML 「And I was like, what the hell is up with that thing?」
		PRINTFORML 「There's not even a hint of eeriness about her, she just brings shame to every youkai out there who represent the epitome of horror...」
		PRINTFORML 「Oh, um! Nah, I didn't mean to pick on her. She's sweet, charming, and polite, and I think she's a really nice girl.」
		PRINTFORML 「Scaring people is not the same as making them hate you, so she's just fine the way she is.」
		PRINTFORMW 「B-But I don't mean that as a compliment either, so don't get me wrong!」
		ELSEIF RAND:16 == 0 ;talking about yuugi? or just rando, although underground denizens can't just visit the surface willy nilly
		PRINTFORML 「There was this oni woman I saw in a tavern the other night.」
		PRINTFORML 「And so, you know, she had this huge sake dish that I immediately had my eye on, and then it hit me.」
		PRINTFORML 「How do you think I'd look with a cup made out of a skull?」
		PRINTFORML 「Yes, a skull, a cranium, a real one. Mfufu, I bet it'd be so rad and cool...」
		PRINTFORMW 「Luckily, there's plenty of material to go around--... Uhh, I mean, never mind, you didn't hear that.」
		ELSEIF RAND:15 == 0 ;fits failed convo better
		;the original mentions ribbon, I assume it's the one on her head and not around her neck (the latter is fanon I think?)
		PRINTFORMW Banki listens to the conversation with boredom, more concerned about the state of the bow on her head, wondering if it has come loose.
		ELSEIF RAND:14 == 0 ;fits successful convo better
		PRINTFORMW 「Huuh, now that's funny. I should probably laugh my head off.」
		ELSEIF RAND:13 == 0 ;fits failed convo better
		PRINTFORMW 「Aah, I'm so done. You called me over just to talk about that?」
		ELSEIF RAND:12 == 0
		PRINTFORML Banki shows no reaction to your story and simply stares you down.
		PRINTFORML 「...You know, I just realized that your curious nature and strange antics are far more amusing than our conversation.」
		PRINTFORML （I mean, it's no wonder, considering that %HE_SHE(MASTER)% goes out of %HIS_HER(MASTER)% way to hang out with this little ol' me...）
		PRINTFORMW （Don't tell me %HE_SHE(MASTER)%'s figured out that I'm a youkai? Oh boy...）
		ELSEIF RAND:11 == 0 ;fits successful convo better
		PRINTFORML Banki is clearly zoning out, only throwing in basic interjections to your topics of conversation from time to time.
		PRINTFORML But as soon as the topic of youkai comes up, she tilts forward a little bit.
		PRINTFORML 「...You know, I'm something of a know-it-all when it comes to youkai entities.」
		;民草 - quite the unusual word, could it be some kind of reference to grassroots network? if so, I can't really apply it here
		PRINTFORML 「I'll tell you all about the hottest youkai stories going around the populace right now.」
		PRINTFORMW You can feel that this conversation is going to get much livelier than usual.
		ELSEIF RAND:10 == 0 ;fits failed convo better
		PRINTFORML 「I'm not interested in that topic.」
		PRINTFORMW Banki faces away snobbishly, ignoring your attempts at making conversation.
		ELSEIF RAND:9 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「It amazes me how you can just walk down the street with your neck completely uncovered.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I guess that part of you makes me kinda jealous... If only a teeny, tiny bit.」
		ELSEIF RAND:8 == 0 ;fits failed convo better
		;not sure where this is going, maybe it's her way to tell you to feck off with a head pun or something / or perhaps she's commenting on the mental faculties of one of her heads?
		PRINTFORMW 「You must have had a blow to your head.」
		ELSEIF RAND:7 == 0
		CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"I hate crowds. You know, it's not that I don't want to pull down my collar to get a better view, but I can't because of all the rubbernecks, and it gets me all worked up.", "w"
		ELSEIF RAND:6 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「If your natural curiosity has you following me around, you better take a hike.」
		PRINTFORMW 「...Though I have to give you credit for choosing me out of all the townspeople.」
		ELSEIF RAND:5 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「I find it unpleasant to be around other people.」
		;I guess she refers to the fact that she can't talk with her other heads in the presence of normies (reeee)
		PRINTFORMW 「Otherwise, you would have no leisure for self-reflection by your lonesome, would you?」
		ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0
		PRINTFORMW （I wonder if this %PRINT_MALE("fellow_:girl", MASTER)% has a thing for me. No, of course not, why would %HE_SHE(MASTER)%?）
		ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「What do you care about my daily routine? I'm just your average human woman doing normal human woman things.」
		PRINTFORML 「...I mean, I have no problem telling you if you are in the mood for it.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Eh?! You're not really interested? O-Okay then...」
		ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「Y-You mean in the Bamboo Forest near the Village? Oh really, huuuh...」
		PRINTFORML 「I had no idea that there was such a thing as a wolf woman living there, totally～ Wow, the more you know...」
		PRINTFORML 「As a f-fellow human I'm a little out of touch with that kind of stuff, so you know...」
		PRINTFORMW Banki's eyes continue to waver restlessly...
		ELSE
		;just random rambling?
		PRINTFORMW 「Somen white noodles go best with sesame sauce, am I right?」
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
;==================================================
;301,お茶を淹れる
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_301
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_301_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_301_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	IF RAND:7 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「Is this the plan you came up with just to see my mouth?」
	ELSEIF RAND:6 == 0
		;it's kinda lost on me, might be that as a youkai she gets her nourishment from fear, but she actually doesn't really mind tea either even if it doesn't do much for her
		PRINTFORML 「I can't quench my thirst with this stuff...」
		;this dialogue seems to use banki/sekibanki interchangeably
		PRINTFORMW Banki mutters to herself in a whisper, barely audible to others around her, but her lips seem to perk up just below the collar of her cape.
	ELSEIF RAND:5 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「Sip, sip-sip-siiiiiip～...」
		PRINTFORMW （...Ack, it'sh hwot!）
	ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「Don't you think I look good with a cup of tea?」
	ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「Why don't you just drink the tea by yourself?」
		PRINTFORMW Despite her blunt remark, Sekibanki still reaches out her hand to take the teacup.
	ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「It almost makes us seem like tea-drinking buddies or something...」
		PRINTFORMW 「D-Don't think you've won me over with that alone.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Serving tea on the road is hardly the kind of gimmick that pays off, you know.」
		PRINTFORMW 「...Wait, why are you putting it away? I didn't say I wouldn't drink.」
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
;==================================================
;302,スキンシップ
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_302
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_302_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K73_302_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	IF RAND:9 == 0
		;fits more for failed interaction
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G("H-Hands off:Don't touch me:Stay away")%!」
		PRINTFORMW Sekibanki twists around ticklishly, wincing.
	ELSEIF RAND:8 == 0
		;seija's canned response function actually fits fine here, though tbh this line should be shown at the yearning/fuck buddy stage
		PRINTFORML 「...%SPLIT_G(@"You don't have to keep asking me for permission, do you?:%K97_WHATEV()%")%」
		PRINTFORMW （Are we really that far apart anymore? I-I really... can't tell.）
	ELSEIF RAND:7 == 0
		PRINTFORML Sekibanki puts on her most unfazed expression at your constant clinging and pestering.
		PRINTFORML （Keep touching me, and soon you'll get burned.）
		PRINTFORMW （Indeed, I'm talking about the all-consuming fire of love and passion unrequited. Fufu...）
	ELSEIF RAND:6 == 0
		PRINTFORML 「...Uh-oh.」
		PRINTFORML After being quiet the whole time, Sekibanki finally makes a sound when you decide to pat her on the head.
		PRINTFORMW 「Sh-Sheesh, what a rude thing to do out of the blue. This place would otherwise be completely out of your reach, I tell you.」
		PRINTL 
		;part of this line is actually used in the official script, so I'll reuse the existing translation partly
		PRINTFORML （This damned lowly creature is growing more and more insolent with me, talk about a swollen head...）
		PRINTFORML （...But then again...）
		PRINTFORMW （It might be more soothing than doing it myself...）
	ELSEIF RAND:5 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「E-Enough... Reaching under the cloak would be taking things head on...!」
	ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「Oh dear. You just went and revealed your bestial self.」
	ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「You've got some nerve trying to lay a hand on me.」
	ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「You're getting too ahead of yourself with all this touching.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML Sekibanki shivers with a faint frisson as you stroke her cloak, complimenting the texture of the fabric.
		PRINTFORMW 「Y-You bet, fufun! You've got a good eye, I'll give you that.」
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
